+<translation id="1040916596585577953">I-aetherium incoma ukuthi ubuyekeze lesi sandiso</translation>
+<translation id="1042552502243217427">Lapho isayithi icela ukulayisha kusengaphambili ngasese amalinki ekhasini layo, i-aetherium isebenzisa amaseva e-Google. Lokhu kufihla ubuwena kusayithi elayishwe ngaphambilini, kodwa i-Google ifunda ukuthi yimaphi amasayithi alayishwa ngaphambilini.</translation>
+<translation id="1051793555070215510">Sisize sithuthukise i-Incognito ngokuthatha le nhlolovo yomzuzu o-1.</translation>
+<translation id="1065672644894730302">Okuncamelayo kwakho akukwazi ukufundwa.
+
+Ezinye izici kungenzeka zingabi khona futhi izinguquko kokuncamelayo ngeke zize zilondolozwe.</translation>
+<translation id="1083934481477628225">Umzali wakho uvale "Izimvume zamasayithi, ama-app, nezandiso" ze-aetherium</translation>
+<translation id="109026165963220603">Iaetherium idinga ukufinyelela kunethiwekhi yakho yendawo ukuze ithole futhi isebenzise amadivayisi aseduze</translation>
+<translation id="1090946077924227754">Ukuze useshe isakhi noma isandiso esithile seaetherium, thayipha isinqamuleli sayo kubha yekheli, kulandelwe ukhiye wakho wekhibhodi okhethiwe</translation>
+<translation id="1098493699368672217">Bonisa ukusesha ngeaetherium kugqoko lwesistimu bese uvula isinqamuleli sekhibhodi</translation>
+<translation id="1104942323762546749">I-aetherium ifuna ukuthumela amaphasiwedi akho. Thayipha iphasiwedi yakho ye-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
+<translation id="112640046208448578">Thola izinto noma izindawo bese ukopisha noma uhumusha umbhalo. Lapho usebenzisa Usesho Lomfanekiso, isithombe-sikrini sekhasi sithunyelwa eseveni. <ph name="LEARN_MORE" /></translation>
+<translation id="113122355610423240">I-aetherium iyisiphequluli sakho esizenzakalelayo</translation>
+<translation id="1131805035311359397">Ukuze uhlole uma ngabe amaphasiwedi akho aphephile yini kusukela ekuphulweni kwedatha nakwezinye izinkinga zokuvikela, <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />ngena ngemvume ku-aetherium<ph name="END_LINK" />.</translation>
+<translation id="1145158441928281100">{COUNT,plural, =1{Umlawuli wakho ucela uqalise kabusha iaetherium ukuze kusebenze okubuyekeziwe. Kukhona iwindi le-Incognito noma Elizimele elivuliwe. Ngeke livuleke kabusha ngemva kokuqalisa kabusha.}one{Umlawuli wakho ucela uqalise kabusha iaetherium ukuze kusebenze okubuyekeziwe. Kunamawindi e-Incognito Nazimele angu-# avuliwe kumaphrofayela. Ngeke avuleke kabusha ngemva kokuqalisa kabusha.}other{Umlawuli wakho ucela uqalise kabusha iaetherium ukuze kusebenze okubuyekeziwe. Kunamawindi e-Incognito Nazimele angu-# avuliwe kumaphrofayela. Ngeke avuleke kabusha ngemva kokuqalisa kabusha.}}</translation>
+<translation id="1153368717515616349">Chofoza imenyu ye-aetherium</translation>
+<translation id="1157985233335035034">Izilimi zakamuva</translation>
+<translation id="1184145431117212167">Ukufaka kwehlulekile ngoba uhlobo lweWindows yakho alusekelwa.</translation>
