+<translation id="1186645291482254714">Thola izexwayiso zokulandelela intengo nge-aetherium efonini yakho</translation>
+<translation id="1203500561924088507">Siyabonga ngokufaka. Kufanele uqale kabusha ibhrawuza yakho ngaphambi kokusebenzisa i-<ph name="BUNDLE_NAME" />.</translation>
+<translation id="1222365723190436821">I-<ph name="IMPORTANT_UPDATE" /> isalungiswa. Ukuze ugcine ukubhrawuza kwakho kuphephile, iaetherium izobuyekeza ngokuzayo uma ungasebenzi ngo-<ph name="IDLE_DURATION" />.</translation>
+<translation id="1232234696885483911">Uma uvula Usesho Lomfanekiso, isihloko sekhasi, i-URL, nekhontenti, okuhlanganisa ama-PDF, kuzothunyelwa ngokuzenzekelayo kuseva. <ph name="LEARN_MORE" /></translation>
+<translation id="123265588161106468">Ngenkathi ungene ngemvume, ungasebenzisa amaphasiwedi akho nokuningi ngeGoogle Account yakho kuaetherium. Ukuze ushintshe lokhu, iya kokuthi “I-akhawunti yakho kuaetherium”.</translation>
+<translation id="1244381985120794049">Bonisa iGemini kuaetherium kubha yemenyu yeMac</translation>
+<translation id="1257483544893909270">Ukuze ukhethe ingxenye yesikrini kuGemini kuaetherium, sebenzisa isinqamuleli sekhibhodi.</translation>
+<translation id="1262876892872089030">Ngenkathi le thebhu ingasebenzi, inkumbulo iye yenzelwa isikhala ukugcina i-aetherium ishesha. Ungakhetha ukungahlanganisi le sayithi ekutheni ibe engasebenzi.</translation>
+<translation id="1265577313130862557">I-aetherium ivimbele lokhu kudawunilodwa ngoba ifayela liyingozi</translation>
+<translation id="126567311906253476">Uma ungena ngemvume kumasevisi eGoogle efana neGmail noma iYouTube nge-<ph name="USER_EMAIL" />, ungangena ngemvume ngokuzenzakalela kuaetherium nge-akhawunti efanayo</translation>
