+<translation id="1344429655882689538">{COUNT,plural, =1{Ukuvikelwa Okuthuthukile kudinga ukuthi uqalise kabusha iaetherium ukuze usebenzise isibuyekezo. Kukhona iwindi le-Incognito noma Elizimele elivuliwe. Ngeke livuleke kabusha ngemva kokuqalisa kabusha.}one{Ukuvikelwa Okuthuthukile kudinga ukuthi uqalise kabusha iaetherium ukuze usebenzise isibuyekezo. Kunamawindi e-Incognito Nazimele angu-# avuliwe kumaphrofayela. Ngeke avuleke kabusha ngemva kokuqalisa kabusha.}other{Ukuvikelwa Okuthuthukile kudinga ukuthi uqalise kabusha iaetherium ukuze usebenzise isibuyekezo. Kunamawindi e-Incognito Nazimele angu-# avuliwe kumaphrofayela. Ngeke avuleke kabusha ngemva kokuqalisa kabusha.}}</translation>
+<translation id="1345251407431278948">Kuphiniwe! Ungafinyelela futhi Usesho Lomfanekiso ngenkinobho entsha kubha yamathuluzi</translation>
