+<translation id="1607715478322902680">{COUNT,plural, =0{Umlawuli wakho udinga ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-aetherium ukuze kusetshenziswe isibuyekezo}=1{Umlawuli wakho udinga ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-aetherium ukuze kusetshenziswe isibuyekezo. Iwindi lakho le-Incognito ngeke liphinde livuleke.}one{Umlawuli wakho udinga ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-aetherium ukuze kusetshenziswe isibuyekezo. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}other{Umlawuli wakho udinga ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-aetherium ukuze kusetshenziswe isibuyekezo. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}}</translation>
+<translation id="1623563412065267963">Thola okuhamba phambili kweGoogle nge-app yeaetherium efonini yakho</translation>
+<translation id="1625909126243026060">Buyekeza izilawuli eziyinhloko zobumfihlo nokuvikeleka ku-aetherium</translation>
