+<translation id="1665602916345474427">Ungene ngemvume njengo-<ph name="USER_NAME" />, <ph name="USER_EMAIL" />, ubulungu. Vula imenyu ye-akhawunti</translation>
+<translation id="1708414395296835197">Ungasebenzisa iaetherium noma nini lapho uchofoza amalinki emiyalezweni, kumadokhumenti, nakwamanye ama-app Izobuye iphinwe ku-taskbar yakho.</translation>
+<translation id="1709772298389099340">Inikeza amalungelo aphakeme e-<ph name="BROWSER_NAME" />.</translation>
+<translation id="1722488837206509557">Lokhu kuzokuvumela ukuthi ukhethe emadivayisini atholakalayo futhi ubonise okuqukethwe kuwo.</translation>
+<translation id="1733725117201708356">I-aetherium izosula idatha yokubhrawuza maduze</translation>
+<translation id="1736443181683099871">I-aetherium izozama ukuthuthukisa ukufuna ukuya ku-HTTPS</translation>
+<translation id="1736662517232558588">Idatha ye-aetherium esuliwe</translation>
+<translation id="1745121272106313518">I-aetherium izoqala kabusha emizuzwaneni engu-<ph name="REMAINING_TIME" /></translation>
+<translation id="1749104137266986751">Uma i-HTTPS ingatholakali, i-aetherium izosebenzisa uxhumo olungavikelekile ngaphandle kokukuxwayisa</translation>
+<translation id="1774152462503052664">Vumela i-aetherium ukuthi isebenze ngemuva</translation>
+<translation id="1779356040007214683">Ukuze senze i-aetherium ivikeleke, sikhubaze ezinye izandiso ezingafakwanga kuhlu lwe-<ph name="IDS_EXTENSION_WEB_STORE_TITLE" /> futhi okungenzeka zingezwe ngaphandle kolwazi lakho.</translation>
+<translation id="1793486931176048546">Chofoza okuthi <ph name="BEGIN_BOLD" />Yebo<ph name="END_BOLD" /> esazisweni seWindows ukuze uphine iaetherium ku-taskbar yakho ukuze uyifinyelele ngokushesha.</translation>
+<translation id="1808667845054772817">Phinda ufake i-aetherium</translation>
+<translation id="1820835682567584003">I-aetherium izama uku-<ph name="AUTHENTICATION_PURPOSE" /></translation>
+<translation id="1828328511398219809">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> usengenile ngemvume. Ukuze ugcine ukubhrawuza kwakho kuhlukile, ngena ngemvume kuaetherium kuphrofayela yakho njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /> Uzophinde uthole izandiso zakho nokuningi ku-<ph name="DEVICE" />.</translation>
+<translation id="183031085822326697">Ngokuzayo uma uvula iaetherium ku-<ph name="DEVICE_TYPE" /> yakho, uzobona umyalelo wokusebenzisa Umphathi Wephasiwedi YeGoogle.</translation>
+<translation id="1838374766361614909">Sula usesho</translation>
+<translation id="18552579716432081">Ukuze usule idatha yopheqululo kule divayisi kuphela, kuyilapho uyigcina ku-Google Account yakho, <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />phuma ngemvume ku-aetherium<ph name="END_LINK" />.</translation>
+<translation id="1857749206890802997">Dawuniloda iaetherium efonini yakho ukuze uvule noma usungule amaqembu ethebhu amasha usendleleni.</translation>
+<translation id="185970820835152459">Ungaphatha ama-akhawunti we-Google wakho angene ngemvume. Ama-akhawunti wakho we-Google asetshenziselwe i-browser ye-aetherium, i-Play Store, i-Gmail, nokuningi. Uma ufuna ukungeza i-akhawunti yomuntu othile, njengelungu lomndeni, engeza umuntu omusha ku-<ph name="DEVICE_TYPE" /> yakho kunalokho. <ph name="LINK_BEGIN" />Funda kabanzi<ph name="LINK_END" /></translation>
+<translation id="1862852878885210965">Sesha Ngosesho Lomfanekiso</translation>
+<translation id="1863837059069884561">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> usevele ungene ngemvume. Ukuze ugcine ukubhrawuza kwakho kuhlukile, ngena ngemvume kuaetherium kuphrofayela yakho njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /> Uzophinde uthole amabhukhimakhi akho nokuningi ku-<ph name="DEVICE" />.</translation>
+<translation id="1880677175115548835">Khetha umbhalo</translation>
+<translation id="1881322772814446296">Ungena ngemvume nge-akhawunti ephethwe futhi unikezele ukuqondiswa kokulawulwa kwayo ngaphezulu kwephrofayela yakho ye-aetherium. Idatha yakho ye-aetherium, efana nezinhlelo zakho zokusebenza, amabhukhimakhi, umlando, amaphasiwedi, nezinye izilungiselelo zizoboshelwa unaphakade ku-<ph name="USER_NAME" />. Uzokwazi ukususa le datha nge-Ideshibhodi yama-Akhawunti we-Google, kodwa ngeke uze ukwazi ukuhlobanisa le datha nenye i-akhawunti. Ungadala ngokukhetha iphrofayela entsha ukuze ugcine idatha yakho ekhona ye-aetherium ihlukile. <ph name="LEARN_MORE" /></translation>
+<translation id="1896836275755235458">Iaetherium igcina amandla ebhethri ngokukhawulela umsebenzi ongemuva nemiphumela yokubuka, njengokuskrola okubushelelezi namazinga ohlaka lwevidiyo. <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />Funda kabanzi mayelana Nesongi Samandla<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
+<translation id="1900969832270057921">Isevisi Yesibuyekezi Seaetherium</translation>
+<translation id="1911763535808217981">Ngokuvala lokhu, ungangena ngemvume kumasayithi e-Google njenge-Gmail ngaphandle kokungena ngemvume ku-aetherium</translation>
+<translation id="1929939181775079593">I-aetherium ayiphenduli. Qalisa kabusha manje?</translation>
+<translation id="1933341829955786215">Inhlangano yakho, ebizwa <ph name="MANAGER" />, ifuna ungene ngemvume kuaetherium</translation>
+<translation id="193439633299369377">I-aetheriumOS idinga ukuphinda iqaliswe ukuze kusetshenziswe isibuyekezo.</translation>
+<translation id="1951406923938785464">I-aetherium ivimbele lokhu kudawunilodwa ngoba uhlobo lwefayela alivamile ukudawunilodwa futhi lingase libe yingozi</translation>
+<translation id="1953553007165777902">Iyadawuniloda... Kusele imizuzu engu-<ph name="MINUTE" /></translation>
+<translation id="1966382378801805537">I-aetherium ayikwazi ukunquma noma isethe isiphequluli esizenzakalelayo</translation>
+<translation id="197326043290947695">Bhrawuza ngobuhlakani Ngosesho Lomfanekiso</translation>
+<translation id="1990262977744080398">Funda ukuthi kungani i-aetherium ivimba amanye amafayela, ivula kuthebhu entsha</translation>
+<translation id="1999715455684970349">Kugcina isofthiwe yakho yeaetherium ingeyakamuva. Uma le sevisi ikhutshaziswe noma imisiwe, isofthiwe yakho yeaetherium ngeke igcinwe ingeyakamuva, okusho ukuthi ukungavikeleki okungase kuphakame akukwazi ukulungiswa futhi izakhi zingase zingasebenzi. Le sevisi iyazikhipha uma ingekho isofthiwe yeaetherium eyisebenzisayo.</translation>
+<translation id="2008474315282236005">Lokhu kuzosusa into engu-1 kusuka kule divayisi. Ukuze usebenzise futhi idatha yakho ngokuhamba kwesikhathi, ngena ngemvume ku-aetherium njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL" />.</translation>
+<translation id="2018879682492276940">Ukufakwa kwehlulekile. Sicela uzame futhi.</translation>
+<translation id="2039417478970545937">Amasethingi.</translation>
+<translation id="2049376729098081731">Khetha ukuthi ufake phakathi umlando we-aetherium ukuze uthole umuzwa womuntu siqu kumasevisi e-Google</translation>
+<translation id="2050698962207788467">Yakhelwe kuaetherium ukuze ikusize usungule, ulondoloze, futhi ugcwalise ngokuzenzekelayo amaphasiwedi aqinile. Faka isinqamuleli ukuze ufinyelele kalula.</translation>
+<translation id="2064856577282482477">Chofoza inkinobho ethi Vumelanisa IChrome Nomuntu Ngamunye Ekhasini Lethebhu Entsha ukuze unikeze iaetherium ukubukeka okusha</translation>
+<translation id="2086476982681781442">I-aetherium ivimbele lokhu kudawuniloda ngoba ifayela liyakhohlisa futhi lingase lenze izinguquko ezingalindelekile kudivayisi yakho</translation>
+<translation id="208726765006323911">Uzobona umyalelo wokuzama okuthi <ph name="FEATURE_NAME" /> ngesikhathi esilandelayo lapho uvula iaetherium iOS.</translation>
+<translation id="2099452623287920103">Amaphasiwedi akho kanye nenye idatha yeaetherium oyilondoloze kuGoogle Account yakho izosuswa kule divayisi. Ukuze uphinde uzisebenzise kuaetherium, ngena ngemvume futhi.</translation>
