+<translation id="4654639495249754755">Iphrofayela yeaetherium</translation>
+<translation id="4665829708273112819">Isexwayiso: I-aetherium ayikwazi ukuvimbela izandiso kusuka ekurekhodeni umlando wakho wokudlulisa amehlo. Ukuze ukhubaze lesi sandiso kumodi ye-incognito, yekisa ukukhetha le nketho.</translation>
