+<translation id="4673710618874938871">Ungene ngemvume njengo-<ph name="USER_NAME" />, ubulungu. Vula imenyu ye-akhawunti</translation>
+<translation id="4677944499843243528">Iphrofayela ibukeka isetshenziswa enye inqubo ye-aetherium (<ph name="PROCESS_ID" />) kwenye ikhompyutha (<ph name="HOST_NAME" />). I-aetherium ikhiye iphrofayela ukuze ingamosheki. Uma uqinisekile ukuthi azikho ezinye izinqubo ezisebenzisa le phrofayela, ungavula iphrofayela uphinde uqalise i-aetherium.</translation>
+<translation id="4680828127924988555">Khansela Ukufaka</translation>
+<translation id="469259825538636168">Enye idatha yakho yeaetherium ayikalondolozwa kuGoogle Account. Zama ukulinda imizuzu embalwa ngaphambi kokuphuma ngemvume. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha izosulwa.</translation>
+<translation id="4708193446201257833">Ngenkathi ungene ngemvume, ungasebenzisa amaphasiwedi akho nokuningi ukusuka kuGoogle Account yakho kuaetherium. I-<ph name="SHORTCUT" /> ingashintsha amasethingi wakho wamasevisi eGoogle.</translation>
+<translation id="4708774505295300557">Umuntu othile ungene ngemvume ngaphambilini ku-aetherium kule khompuyutha njengo-<ph name="ACCOUNT_EMAIL_LAST" />. Sicela udale umsebenzisi omusha we-aetherium ukuze ugcine ulwazi lwakho luhlukile.</translation>
+<translation id="4724676981607797757">Ukufaka kuhlulekile ngenxa yephutha lephrothokholi engasekelwe.</translation>
+<translation id="4746050847053251315">Phuma ku-aetherium noma kunjalo?</translation>
+<translation id="4748217263233248895">Isibuyekezo esibalulekile sokuvikela se-aetherium sisanda kufakwa. Qalisa kabusha manje bese sizobuyisela amathebhu akho.</translation>
+<translation id="4771701986670315895">Awukavakashi kamuva nje. Iaetherium isuse i-<ph name="PERMISSION_1" />, i-<ph name="PERMISSION_2" />, nokunye okungu-<ph name="COUNT" /> okwengeziwe</translation>
+<translation id="4786083865378785874">Uma iGemini kuaetherium ivuliwe, iphaneli eseceleni ihlala ivuliwe uma usungula amathebhu amasha</translation>
