+<translation id="275588974610408078">Ukubika kokuphahlazeka akutholakali ku-aetherium.</translation>
+<translation id="3064346599913645280">Ubuka ikhasi le-aetherium eliphephile</translation>
+<translation id="3255926992597692024">I-aetherium izama ukulungisa amasethingi okugcwalisa izindlela zokukhokha.</translation>
