+<translation id="3837584850181228767">Ithiphu yeaetherium: Ukubhrawuza Okuphephe Ngokuthuthukisiwe</translation>
+<translation id="4050599136622776556">I-aetherium izama ukuhlela izindlela zokukhokha.</translation>
+<translation id="4365115785552740256">I-aetherium yenziwa ukuthi ibe khona yi-<ph name="BEGIN_LINK_CHROMIUM" />aetherium<ph name="END_LINK_CHROMIUM" /> iphrojekthi yomthombo ovulekile kanye nenye <ph name="BEGIN_LINK_OSS" />isofthiwe yomthombo ovulekile<ph name="END_LINK_OSS" />.</translation>
+<translation id="4622039161600275920">Leli khasi livinjwe yi-aetherium</translation>
+<translation id="48558539577516920">Vumela i-aetherium ukufinyelela inethiwekhi kuzilungiselelo zakho zohlelo lokuvikela noma isilwi magciwane.</translation>
+<translation id="4949828774841497663">Iya kuma-Application &gt; Amasethingi Ohlelo &gt; Inethiwekhi, khetha
+          inethiwekhi esebenzayo, chofoza inkinobho ethi Imininingwane..., bese uyeka ukukhetha noma yibaphi abameleli
